ily. The community is quiet and peaceful, has two swimming pools, one that is adapted for people with ‌reduced ‌mobility, ‌and ‌lush ‌well-maintained ‌gardens. Included ‌in the ‌price there is a generous ‌parking ‌space ‌and ‌1 ‌storage rooms. This is ‌an ‌ideal ‌investment, ‌holiday ‌or ‌forever ‌home."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Sur","Reformado Recientemente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Urbanas","Ascensor","Armarios Empotrados","Terraza Privada","Trastero","Baño En-Suite","Amueblada","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Portero Automático","Alarma","Seguridad 24 Horas","Comunitario"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Sea","Close To Town","South","Recently Renovated","Communal","Air Conditioning","Urban","Lift","Fitted Wardrobes","Private Terrace","Storage Room","Ensuite Bathroom","Fully Furnished","Communal","Gated Complex","Entry Phone","Alarm System","24 Hour Security","Communal"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available"}